Cloud services were discussed in this modules 

cloud sevices includes the following 
1: Software as a service ( SaaS )
2: Platform as a service ( PaaS )
3: Infrastructure as a service ( IaaS )

There are 4 types of cloud
1: Public Cloud 
2: Private Cloud 
3: Hybrid Cloud 
4: Community Cloud

Virtualization 
This is a foundation of cloud services, virtualization means creating a virtual machine rather than physical version of something
it has following advantages 
1: Less equipment
2: Less power consumed
3: Less space is required
